{
  "_comment": [
    "PLACEHOLDER — not a working config. See docs/FIREBASE.md.",
    "Firebase console -> Project settings -> Your apps -> Android app -> Download google-services.json.",
    "Save the real file as mobile/android/app/google-services.json (same directory as this file).",
    "The real file is gitignored (.gitignore: **/google-services.json) — never commit it.",
    "package_name MUST equal applicationId in mobile/android/app/build.gradle (com.fironperformance).",
    "android/app/build.gradle only applies the google-services plugin when the real file exists, so",
    "the Android build keeps working on a clone that has none — push is simply disabled."
